---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Base title="Build your U.S. business" description="ARONIA helps established European B2B technology companies focus their U.S. go-to-market, build credibility, and turn market decisions into execution.">
<div id="top" class="wrap home-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">U.S. go-to-market for European B2B tech</span><h1>Build your<br/>U.S. <span class="serif copper">business.</span></h1><p class="lead">You built a successful business in Europe.<br/>Now it’s time to build one here.</p><p class="muted">Find the right market. Build local credibility.<br/>Create the customer conversations that move you forward.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://calendly.com/aronia/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book an introduction <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#programs">Explore how we work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><aside class="hero-graphic" aria-label="From European traction to U.S. opportunity"><div class="graphic-title">A focused path into the market</div><div class="journey-row"><svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="#6b6b68"><circle cx="10" cy="16" r="4"/><circle cx="31" cy="9" r="4"/><circle cx="49" cy="20" r="4"/><circle cx="9" cy="40" r="4"/><circle cx="28" cy="30" r="4"/><circle cx="47" cy="44" r="4"/><circle cx="27" cy="52" r="4"/></g></svg><div><h3>Start with your strengths.</h3><p>Your customers, experience, and proven offer are the starting point.</p></div></div><div class="journey-row"><svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="31" cy="30" r="23" stroke="#b3aba0"/><circle cx="31" cy="30" r="14" stroke="#c96b3b"/><circle cx="31" cy="30" r="6" fill="#c96b3b"/><path d="M31 1v9m0 40v9M1 30h9m40 0h9" stroke="#6b6b68"/></svg><div><h3>Choose where to focus.</h3><p>One market, a clear buyer, and a reason to believe.</p></div></div><div class="journey-row"><svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="30" cy="17" r="8" fill="#c96b3b"/><path d="M16 50c0-13 5-21 14-21s14 8 14 21" stroke="#c96b3b" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="25" r="5" stroke="#6b6b68"/><circle cx="51" cy="25" r="5" stroke="#6b6b68"/><path d="M1 48c0-9 3-15 9-15m49 15c0-9-3-15-9-15" stroke="#6b6b68"/></svg><div><h3>Get into the market.</h3><p>Build relationships, create conversations, and learn from real buyers.</p></div></div><p class="journey-note">European traction <span class="copper">→</span> U.S. opportunity</p></aside></div>
<section class="credibility-strip"><div class="wrap"><span class="small-label">Featured &amp; recognized</span><div class="logo-carousel"><div class="logo-row carousel-track">{[['forbes','Forbes'],['fastcompany','Fast Company'],['inc5000','Inc. 5000'],['ey-entrepreneur-of-the-year','EY Entrepreneur of the Year'],['techcrunch','TechCrunch'],['tedx','TEDx']].map(([f,a])=><img src={`/assets/logos/featured/${f}-transparent.png`} alt={a} width="220" height="58" loading="lazy"/>)}</div></div></div></section>
<section id="method" class="section sand"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">The ARONIA approach</span><div><h2>Focus before scale.</h2><p class="lead">European traction gives you something valuable to build from. It does not automatically create U.S. demand.</p><p class="muted">Before investing heavily in hiring, marketing, or events, make the choices that matter: where to compete, who to target, what to offer, and why a U.S. buyer should believe you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/foundation-sprint/">Build the foundation first <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section id="programs" class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><div><h2>From clear decisions<br/>to market execution.</h2><p class="muted">Start where your business needs support. Build the foundation, activate it in the market, or bring experienced U.S. leadership alongside your team.</p></div></div><div class="service-list"><a class="service-row" href="/foundation-sprint/"><span class="num">01</span><div><h3>Foundation Sprint</h3><span class="tag">Choose your starting point</span></div><p>Turn your strengths and customer evidence into a focused U.S. go-to-market your team can execute.</p><span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="service-row" href="/market-activation/"><span class="num">02</span><div><h3>Market Activation</h3><span class="tag">Put the direction to work</span></div><p>Translate the foundation into targeted outreach, relationships, customer conversations, and opportunities.</p><span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="service-row" href="/fractional-us-growth-advisor/"><span class="num">03</span><div><h3>Fractional U.S. Growth Advisor</h3><span class="tag">Lead the next stage</span></div><p>Bring operator-level judgment and accountability to an existing or developing U.S. business.</p><span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section id="proof" class="section sand"><span id="founder" class="anchor-target"></span><div class="wrap split"><div class="image-frame"><img class="operator-photo" src="/assets/photography/ville-profile.jpg" alt="Ville Houttu" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy"/></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Built from operating experience</span><h2 style="margin-top:24px">I’ve built the U.S. business<br/><span class="serif">from your side of the table.</span></h2><p class="muted">I moved from Finland to California to build Vincit’s U.S. business. From the first customer to a local team, acquisitions, and eight-figure revenue, I learned what it takes to earn your place in a new market.</p><p class="muted">That experience, alongside co-founding and building Privv, is the foundation of ARONIA.</p><div class="number-line"><div><strong>0 → 8 figures</strong><span>Vincit USA revenue</span></div><div><strong>3×</strong><span>Inc. 5000 at Vincit USA</span></div><div><strong>$1M</strong><span>ARR built at Privv</span></div></div><a class="text-link" href="/experience/">Explore the operating experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section id="fit" class="section dark"><div class="wrap fit-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">Is ARONIA a fit?</span><h2 style="margin-top:25px">You have traction.<br/>Now you need<br/><span class="serif">a focused U.S. direction.</span></h2><p class="muted">We work with established European B2B technology companies ready to make decisions and commit people to execution.</p></div><ul class="check-list"><li>Proven customers and traction in your home market</li><li>A mature product or service with credible U.S. potential</li><li>Customer evidence and expertise to build from</li><li>Leadership willing to narrow the initial market and buyer</li><li>Internal commitment to act on what the market teaches you</li></ul></div></section>
<span id="foundation" class="anchor-target"></span><span id="activation" class="anchor-target"></span><span id="recognition-media" class="anchor-target"></span><div id="contact"><CTA/></div>
</Base>
